# Normalize line endings so every checkout (incl. CI runners) is LF.
# The frontmatter parsers and the docs gate depend on this: CRLF would make
# `name: brand-tvc\r` fail the "frontmatter name must match the file" assertion.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.otf binary
*.exe binary
*.zip binary
